Usage: fakectl container stop [OPTIONS] CONTAINER [CONTAINER...]

Stop one or more running containers

Options:
  -s, --signal string   Signal to send (default "SIGTERM")
  -t, --timeout int     Seconds to wait before killing
  -h, --help            Show help
EOF
}

